{
  "about": "Clips Kitty Editor's fonts (our Concat fork, concat-text/fonts), byte for byte, with each font's licence file beside it. family is the name libass matches (name ID 1), typographic the family the editor's presets name (ID 16, else ID 1). ass_scale is (usWinAscent + usWinDescent) / unitsPerEm: libass sizes a font by it, so an ASS Fontsize is the em times ass_scale. scripts lists the writing systems whose every letter is in the file (video/alphabets.py). Made by scripts/sync_editor_presets.py.",
